## 📝 API Quick Reference

### Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/health` | Check API status |
| POST | `/generate-plant-guide` | Generate plant care guide |
| GET | `/` | API information |
| GET | `/docs` | Interactive documentation |
| GET | `/redoc` | Alternative documentation |

### Request Format
```json
{
  "plant_name": "Tomato",
  "plant_type": "Vegetable",
  "climate": "Temperate",
  "sunlight_hours": 6,
  "soil_type": "Loamy",
  "watering_frequency": "Daily",
  "experience_level": "Beginner"
}
```

### Response Format
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "plant_care_guidance": {
    "plant_overview": { ... },
    "growth_stages": [ ... ],
    "daily_care": { ... },
    "common_problems": [ ... ],
    "additional_tips": [ ... ]
  },
  "visual_guide": {
    "status": "success",
    "file_url": "...",
    "message": "..."
  },
  "metadata": {
    "timestamp": "...",
    "processing_time_seconds": 2.5
  }
}
```

## 🔧 Troubleshooting

### "Module not found" errors
```bash
# Make sure virtual environment is activated
source venv/bin/activate  # or venv\Scripts\activate on Windows

# Reinstall dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### CORS errors in browser
Update `.env`:
```env
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://yourapp.com
```

### Slow responses
- Normal! Gemini AI calls take 2-5 seconds
- Use loading indicators in your frontend
- Mock mode is instant for testing

### "API key not configured"
- Add `GEMINI_API_KEY` to `.env` file
- Get key from: https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
- System uses mock data until configured

